Rāma kills Mārīca in deer form --- Rāma hears dire jackal howl behind him --- Rāma fears Mārīca mimicked his voice --- Rāma fears demons seek Sītā death --- Rāma sees dreadful omens on path --- Rāma meets downcast Lakṣmaṇa approaching --- Rāma rebukes Lakṣmaṇa for leaving Sītā --- Rāma says Sītā is surely stolen or eaten